      - 20-25 DB ARASINDA
      - 5-10 DB ARASINDA
      - 15-20 DB ARASINDA
      - 0-5 DB ARASINDA
      - 10-15 DB ARASINDA
      - "H\xDCCRE ENERJ\u0130S\u0130Z"
